OL,3,GNEWSACharity locked out of own bank    
OL,4,Aaccount for months                     
OL,6,FA walking charity has been left unable 
OL,7,Fto access its own bank account for more
OL,8,Fthan two months, describing the        
OL,9,Fsituation as an "absolute nightmare".  
OL,11,FThe Dales Way Association, which helps 
OL,12,Fto protect and maintain an 80-mile     
OL,13,Ffootpath from Ilkley, in West          
OL,14,FYorkshire, to Bowness, in Cumbria, has 
OL,15,Fbeen unable to access funds after it   
OL,16,Ftried to change the named signatory on 
OL,17,Fits Virgin Money account.              
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
