OL,3,GNEWSACharity locked out of own bank    
OL,4,Aaccount for months                     
OL,6,FBev Downes, who was supposed to have   
OL,7,Ftaken over as charity treasurer, and   
OL,8,Fher husband Ryk, who is the            
OL,9,Forganisation's vice-chair, say they    
OL,10,Fhave been forced to pay #1,300 in      
OL,11,Fcharity wages and expenses out of their
OL,12,Fown pocket as a result.                
OL,14,FVirgin Money has been contacted for    
OL,15,Fcomment.                               
